 "text": "Hi, how have you been? There are few family friendly ones. The guy who does In The Garden is nice, or The Story Company for bedtime stories. Then there's a monthly series called Animal Stories, usually read by a wildlife expert. As far as I know, they all follow the BBC guidelines. The guy who does In The Garden does a little bit of singing, but it' all very simple. Probably not at bedtime, just in case she wakes up her twin. A bedtime story app with a bedtime clock is worth trying.",
